{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight, solve, survive \u2014 all in full VR.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreadarion plunges you into moonlit forests, eerie mansions, and shadow-drenched environments where scarce ammo, challenging puzzles, and relentless AI lurk around every corner. Every encounter is intensified by full-body VR interaction and hauntingly realistic 3D audio that makes every creak and whisper feel terrifyingly close.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience true adrenaline with dynamic, realistic firefights in VR space. Reload your weapons by hand, wield melee tools, cut through the darkness with your flashlight, and make every last bullet count. Limited ammunition makes every encounter tactical and tense, while mysterious upgrades can amplify your abilities in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709040/extras/2cde87745e4679f7b0f2018f28a5a569.poster.avif?t=1767711774\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709040/extras/2cde87745e4679f7b0f2018f28a5a569.webm?t=1767711774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709040/extras/2cde87745e4679f7b0f2018f28a5a569.mp4?t=1767711774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your mind with tactile puzzles designed for VR: spin ancient relics, light candles with your virtual lighter, and unlock secret passageways with the movement of your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709040/extras/d2d781d158a2070adc2afdb8affdf1ca.poster.avif?t=1767711774\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709040/extras/d2d781d158a2070adc2afdb8affdf1ca.webm?t=1767711774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709040/extras/d2d781d158a2070adc2afdb8affdf1ca.mp4?t=1767711774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmospheric Worlds, Rich in Detail</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore meticulously crafted environments that deliver absolute immersion: from unnerving candle-lit hallways to fog-choked graveyards, each location offers a unique atmosphere that draws you deeper into a world of nightmare and wonder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709040/extras/722bc2efcfa7ca14423762154d598e39.poster.avif?t=1767711774\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709040/extras/722bc2efcfa7ca14423762154d598e39.webm?t=1767711774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709040/extras/722bc2efcfa7ca14423762154d598e39.mp4?t=1767711774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VR Support</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valve Index, HTC Vive, Meta/Oculus headsets via SteamVR, and all OpenVR devices are supported. Room-scale or standing play is recommended.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the nightmare\u2014before it finds you first.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709040?t=1767711774","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709040/aa98ceb08dacfe233e4ecf01a6c57623065cf623/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767711774","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709040/0c55831bdb950321138f9554c98a2f09d33fa591/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767711774","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709040/0c55831bdb950321138f9554c98a2f09d33fa591/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767711774","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This VR game features intense, first-person combat in a dark, poorly-lit, and eerie environment. Players wield melee weapons and firearms to fight enemies. Combat is accompanied by graphic blood effects and realistic corpses scattered throughout the environment. The game also contains frequent use of strong language. The overall atmosphere, combined with the gore and unsettling settings, may disturb sensitive players."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight, solve, survive \u2014 all in full VR.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreadarion plunges you into moonlit forests, eerie mansions, and shadow-drenched environments where scarce ammo, challenging puzzles, and relentless AI lurk around every corner. Every encounter is intensified by full-body VR interaction and hauntingly realistic 3D audio that makes every creak and whisper feel terrifyingly close.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience true adrenaline with dynamic, realistic firefights in VR space. Reload your weapons by hand, wield melee tools, cut through the darkness with your flashlight, and make every last bullet count. Limited ammunition makes every encounter tactical and tense, while mysterious upgrades can amplify your abilities in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709040/extras/2cde87745e4679f7b0f2018f28a5a569.poster.avif?t=1767711774\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709040/extras/2cde87745e4679f7b0f2018f28a5a569.webm?t=1767711774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709040/extras/2cde87745e4679f7b0f2018f28a5a569.mp4?t=1767711774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your mind with tactile puzzles designed for VR: spin ancient relics, light candles with your virtual lighter, and unlock secret passageways with the movement of your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709040/extras/d2d781d158a2070adc2afdb8affdf1ca.poster.avif?t=1767711774\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709040/extras/d2d781d158a2070adc2afdb8affdf1ca.webm?t=1767711774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709040/extras/d2d781d158a2070adc2afdb8affdf1ca.mp4?t=1767711774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmospheric Worlds, Rich in Detail</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore meticulously crafted environments that deliver absolute immersion: from unnerving candle-lit hallways to fog-choked graveyards, each location offers a unique atmosphere that draws you deeper into a world of nightmare and wonder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709040/extras/722bc2efcfa7ca14423762154d598e39.poster.avif?t=1767711774\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709040/extras/722bc2efcfa7ca14423762154d598e39.webm?t=1767711774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709040/extras/722bc2efcfa7ca14423762154d598e39.mp4?t=1767711774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VR Support</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valve Index, HTC Vive, Meta/Oculus headsets via SteamVR, and all OpenVR devices are supported. Room-scale or standing play is recommended.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the nightmare\u2014before it finds you first.</strong></p>","developers":["Olystrum Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709040/fca23477ee948ad4df5d21b259c41cdc1dba6aba/header.jpg?t=1767711774","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3709040/512112902/ea3550a415b365afc90e33cf41817f43705b8b6f/1751132674/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751133121","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3709040/512112902/ea3550a415b365afc90e33cf41817f43705b8b6f/1751132674/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751133121","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3709040/512112902/ea3550a415b365afc90e33cf41817f43705b8b6f/1751132674/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751133121","